  "description": "“If I were to suddenly pass away… would you look after my family for me?”\n\nFor the sake of my beloved best friend, I married her husband. It was the final wish of my one and only true friend in this world. To protect the two children she left behind, I became their stepmother.\n\nEnduring the deep resentment of her sons and the harsh, judging glares of society, I spent seven long years in a contract...\n\nتابع أحداث وتطورات The Despised Stepmother Begins Her Second Life مع تحديثات يومية وتجربة قراءة فائقة السلاسة وبدقة عالية حصرياً على موقع مانجا تايم (MangaTime).",
